#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/categories/defect-surface.md:1
#: 88135efec4084a3f8b584b15855e6c8e
msgid "缺陷"
msgstr "Defects"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/categories/defect-surface.md:3
#: 54573a55a1f94f09a09b19fd642fb60a
msgid "与卡片 UI 的“缺陷”分组一致。这些卡片负责删位、插入原子、加入吸附原子或生成层错路径。 自由表面的构造单独放在“表面”分组；表面缺陷通常先建表面，再接这里的局部操作。"
msgstr ""
"This section matches the `Defects` group in the card picker. These cards remove "
"sites, insert atoms, add adsorbates, or generate stacking-fault paths. Free surfaces "
"are created separately in the `Surfaces` group; to create a surface defect, usually "
"build the surface first and then apply one of the local operations listed here."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/categories/defect-surface.md:15
#: 55f28a1ec51f461e9abd7791d20eb595
msgid "旧版 `Stacking Fault` 已从添加菜单隐藏，只用于历史 JSON 兼容。新任务统一使用 `GSFE Path`。"
msgstr ""
"The legacy `Stacking Fault` card is hidden from the Add menu and retained only for "
"historical JSON compatibility. Use `GSFE Path` for new workflows."

#~ msgid "缺陷与表面"
#~ msgstr "Defects and surfaces"

#~ msgid "这组卡片改变表面边界或原子数，也包含显式层错路径。表面生成、删位、插入原子和层间滑移 是不同操作；需要组合时，按“先构造边界，再引入局部缺陷”的顺序执行。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "These cards change surface boundaries or atom"
#~ " counts and include explicit stacking-fault "
